@baseUrl = http://localhost:5102
@token = paste-jwt-token-here

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List skins
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Active skin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skins/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create skin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lavender", "primaryColor": "#65558f", "accentColor": "#e89cae", "backgroundColor": "#f8f4fb", "fontFamily": "Georgia" }

### Activate skin (replace id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/skins/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
